ParentVault_claimAsset
├── when the contract is paused
│   └── it should revert with EnforcedPause
├── when the epoch is not claimable
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotClaimable
├── when the user has no withdraw intent for the epoch
│   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoWithdraw
└── when the claim is valid
    ├── it should transfer the correct asset amount to the withdrawer
    ├── it should burn the withdrawn shares
    ├── it should zero remaining counters for a single claimant
    ├── it should delete the withdrawer's withdraw mapping entry
    ├── it should return the correct asset withdraw amount
    ├── it should use totalWithdrawClaimAmount
    ├── it should emit WithdrawClaimed
    ├── it should distribute rounding remainder to the pool-exhausting claimant
    ├── when the withdraw claim rounds down to zero
    │   └── it should burn dust shares without transferring zero asset
    └── when the epoch is deposit-only
        └── it should leave withdraw-side remaining counters at zero
